<section class="cg-explorer-boundary" aria-labelledby="explorer-title" data-explorer><div class="cg-explorer-boundary__statement"><p class="cg-kicker">Try it yourself</p><h2 id="explorer-title">Create your own compound-growth scenarios</h2><p class="cg-explorer-instruction">Change the assumptions, then view the same results as a table or line graph.</p></div><div class="cg-explorer"><form class="cg-explorer__controls" data-explorer-form novalidate><div class="cg-field"><label for="cg-starting-age">Starting age</label><input id="cg-starting-age" aria-describedby="cg-starting-age-error" name="startingAge" type="number" min="18" max="70" step="1" value="25" inputmode="numeric"><span id="cg-starting-age-error" class="cg-field-error" data-error-for="startingAge" aria-live="polite"></span></div><div class="cg-field"><label for="cg-retirement-age">Retirement age</label><input id="cg-retirement-age" aria-describedby="cg-retirement-age-error" name="retirementAge" type="number" min="19" max="80" step="1" value="65" inputmode="numeric"><span id="cg-retirement-age-error" class="cg-field-error" data-error-for="retirementAge" aria-live="polite"></span></div><div class="cg-field"><label for="cg-monthly-contribution">Monthly contribution</label><div class="cg-input-affix"><span aria-hidden="true">$</span><input id="cg-monthly-contribution" aria-describedby="cg-monthly-contribution-error" name="monthlyContribution" type="number" min="0" max="10000" step="10" value="100" inputmode="decimal"></div><span id="cg-monthly-contribution-error" class="cg-field-error" data-error-for="monthlyContribution" aria-live="polite"></span></div><div class="cg-field"><label for="cg-annual-return">Assumed annual return</label><div class="cg-input-affix cg-input-affix--suffix"><input id="cg-annual-return" aria-describedby="cg-annual-return-error" name="annualReturn" type="number" min="0" max="20" step="0.1" value="8" inputmode="decimal"><span aria-hidden="true">%</span></div><span id="cg-annual-return-error" class="cg-field-error" data-error-for="annualReturn" aria-live="polite"></span></div></form><p class="cg-explorer__global-error" data-explorer-error role="status"></p><dl class="cg-summary" aria-label="Exploratory projection summary"><div><dt>Years invested</dt><dd data-summary-years>40</dd></div><div><dt>Total contributions</dt><dd data-summary-contributions>$48,000</dd></div><div><dt>Final projected balance</dt><dd data-summary-balance>$322,108</dd></div><div><dt>Projected investment growth</dt><dd data-summary-growth>$274,108</dd></div></dl><div class="cg-switch" role="tablist" aria-label="Exploratory projection display"><button id="explorer-tab-table" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="explorer-panel-table" tabindex="0" data-explorer-view="table">Table</button><button id="explorer-tab-graph" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="explorer-panel-graph" tabindex="-1" data-explorer-view="graph">Line graph</button></div><div id="explorer-panel-table" class="cg-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="explorer-tab-table" data-explorer-panel="table"><div class="cg-table-wrap"><table class="cg-data-table" data-explorer-table><caption>Exploratory monthly-contribution projection</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Age</th><th scope="col">Years invested</th><th scope="col">Cumulative contributions</th><th scope="col">Projected account balance</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div></div><div id="explorer-panel-graph" class="cg-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="explorer-tab-graph" hidden data-explorer-panel="graph"><div class="cg-chart-frame"><svg class="cg-chart cg-chart--explorer" viewBox="0 0 760 340" role="img" aria-label="Exploratory monthly-contribution projection" data-explorer-chart></svg></div><p class="cg-point-detail" data-explorer-point-detail aria-live="polite">Focus or tap a point to inspect the generated monthly-model values.</p><div class="sr-only" data-explorer-a11y-table></div></div><div class="cg-assumptions"><p><strong>Monthly model:</strong> starting invested balance is fixed at $0. The assumed annual return is converted to an equivalent monthly rate; the existing balance grows each month, then the monthly contribution is added at month-end.</p><p>Illustrative projection only. It does not model fees, taxes, inflation, return volatility, or changes in contributions.</p></div></div></section>
